\f1\fs22 The Commissioner\'92s \'93retirement\'94 produced a happy side effect: a fresh senior vacancy. Plenty in the security industry, not just Halo, had reason to celebrate. PAPER, after all, had moles long-embedded in Ulyssia\'92s police machine. With the right nudge, a loyalist would soon take the chair.
